### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@candidateToken = YOUR_CANDIDATE_JWT_HERE
@recruiterToken = YOUR_RECRUITER_JWT_HERE
@jobId = YOUR_TARGET_JOB_ID

### 1. Apply to Job (Atomic Concurrency-Controlled Slot Reservation)
# @name submitApplication
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/apply
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

{
  "coverLetter": "Experienced software engineer passionate about high-concurrency architectures and cloud infrastructure."
}

### 2. View My Applications (Candidate)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/my
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### 3. View Applicants for Job (Recruiter Owner)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/applicants
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Capture Application ID
@applicationId = YOUR_APPLICATION_ID_HERE

### 4. Update Application Status (Recruiter Owner)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

{
  "status": "shortlisted"
}
